      "writtenOn": "2024-03-06T18:37:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Repeating my comment that since the input signal always has energy, we will never end up in the `else` branch. In order to test a zero-energy input we can add another boolean parameter to the test which instructs it either to use a zero or a non-zero signal.",
