      "writtenOn": "2024-03-06T18:37:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since we are comparing floats, they may end up being not the same withing the `kAbsError`, and that should not be accepted as a success. I don\u0027t see a dedicated `EXPECT` for that, I would suggest `EXPECT_GT(abs(outputRmse - inputRmse), kAbsError)`.",
